Read `AGENTS.md` and `CURSOR.md` before modifying this repository. This project is an agent-portable Compliance Trestle and OSCAL engineering toolkit; Claude Code plugins are one adapter, not the only runtime.

For Cursor-native workflows, use project skills under `.cursor/skills/`:

- `/oscal-document-engineering` for legacy SSP/PDF/DOCX/Markdown to OSCAL
- `/compliance-trestle-engineering` for Trestle workspace operations
- `/import-legacy-ssp`, `/validate-oscal-package`, `/review-oscal-mappings`, and `/workspace-validate` for explicit workflow commands

Canonical portable playbooks live in `agent-skills/`. Preserve source traceability for every mapped OSCAL field, mark uncertain content as `needs_review`, and validate structurally before claiming success.

Do not copy licensed framework text, commit sensitive customer evidence, or invent compliance facts.
